[I] Parental controls support library and tools for GNOME

[T] malcontent implements support for restricting the content accessible to
[T] non-administrator accounts, typically children, on a Linux system. It
[T] provides an accountsservice vendor extension for storing the app filter, a
[T] library for querying and applying it, and the malcontent-control UI for
[T] managing the settings.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pwithnall/malcontent

[A] Philip Withnall <philip@tecnocode.co.uk>
